24
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:52,640
Sea of Devils

25
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:59,640
It's said that many Spirit Beasts live in the Sea of Devils.

26
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,400
Most cultivators here don't follow common sense

27
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,920
and only value strength...

28
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,360
Also...

29
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,200
there are very few women.

30
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,680
Once a woman is discovered,

31
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,240
terrible things will happen to her

32
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:11,040
unless she has powerful backing.
